GPUI Kit 0.7.1 source is vendored at revision
0bbd9870ce420af9feacbf948b21d3824d82dc0b. Its workspace manifests are
normalized for portable local dependencies. GPUI Base includes configurable
secure-mask and repeatable-popup presentation extensions; see vendor/README.md.
GPUI Kit and GPUI are Apache-2.0 dependencies. Their licenses remain with
their respective packages. Icons are supplied by GPUI Kit Assets (Lucide).
docs/upstream-component-exports.rs is an unmodified Apache-2.0 source fixture
from GPUI Kit's crates/component/src/lib.rs at the revision above; its
Longbridge attribution and license are retained at
licenses/gpui-kit-Apache-2.0.txt.
The Lucide ISC and Feather MIT notices remain together in
vendor/gpui-kit-assets/LICENSE-LUCIDE. No Apple font files, standalone SF
Symbol assets, or wallpapers are bundled. Documentation includes application
screenshots with system-rendered chrome and symbols. System fonts and symbols
resolve from macOS at runtime and remain subject to Apple's applicable terms.

Generated application notices contain the actual license texts and source
links for the resolved macOS dependencies. Regenerate them with
scripts/generate-notices.py. They distinguish runtime dependencies from
build/proc-macro and development dependencies and cover default plus optional
features. MPL-2.0 source availability is documented with the included source;
option-ext is a runtime dependency and cbindgen is a build dependency.
